{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The logs show two independent failures: the Connect link reaches an authenticated endpoint without the SPA’s bearer header, and the saved token is marked expired after an invented one-hour lifetime. The current scope string also repeats both `ACTIVITY` and `CALENDAR`, which matches the authorize-step failure reported after calendar access was added."}}
